      "text": [
        "هِ اَلْبَوْلُ وَ اَلْعَذِرَةُ وَ اَلدَّمُ فَقَالَ «طِينُ اَلْمَطَرِ لاَ يُنَجِّسُ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.5 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) was asked about rain-soaked mud that gets on clothes, which may contain urine, feces, and blood.\nImam (as) said: \"Rain-soaked mud does not make (the clothes) impure”."
        ]
      }
